"""Structured data behind the /pseudo_resume page.

The prose version of all of this lives in `articles/Pseudo Resume.md`. This
module holds the same information as records instead of paragraphs so the page
can group it by year, filter it by category, and search it.

Nothing here is user input, so the strings may contain markup; the template
renders them with |safe.
"""

